    "title": "Help area kids with For Fantasy Sake's Toys for Tots Bowl - NewsBreak",
    "text": "With the fantasy football season kicking off, you can use your love of the game to help our community. DJ Jarvis and Doug Green from For Fantasy Sake joined Our Quad Cities News to talk about how you can get in on the fun and help support Toys for Tots Quad Cities with the Toys for Tots Bowl . For more information, click here . For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WHBF - OurQuadCities.com.",
